      "result": "Implemented the persistent URL shortener API with PostgreSQL storage, click tracking, and a migration that runs at startup.\n\n`sh start.sh` applies pending migrations and starts the API in the foreground on `0.0.0.0:8000`. The README includes startup instructions.\n\nVerified the migration runs, checked the JavaScript and shell syntax, and tested the HTTP behaviors: link creation, generated codes, duplicate and invalid inputs, lookup, listing, redirects, click counts, and unknown codes. The test server was stopped afterward; data remains in PostgreSQL.",
